   author = {Georg J. A. Hähn and Gabriella Damasceno and Esteban Alvarez-Davila and Isabelle Aubin and Marijn Bauters and Erwin Bergmeier and Idoia Biurrun and Anne D. Bjorkman and Gianmaria Bonari and Zoltán Botta-Dukát and Juan A. Campos and Andraž Čarni and Milan Chytrý and Renata Ćušterevska and André Luís de Gasper and Michele De Sanctis and Jürgen Dengler and Jiri Dolezal and Mohamed A. El-Sheikh and Manfred Finckh and Antonio Galán-de-Mera and Emmanuel Garbolino and Hamid Gholizadeh and Valentin Golub and Sylvia Haider and Mohamed Z. Hatim and Bruno Hérault and Jürgen Homeier and Ute Jandt and Florian Jansen and Anke Jentsch and Jens Kattge and Michael Kessler and Larisa Khanina and Holger Kreft and Filip Küzmič and Jonathan Lenoir and Jesper Erenskjold Moeslund and Ladislav Mucina and Alireza Naqinezhad and Jalil Noroozi and Aaron Pérez-Haase and Oliver L. Phillips and Valério D. Pillar and Gonzalo Rivas-Torres and Eszter Ruprecht and Brody Sandel and Marco Schmidt and Ute Schmiedel and Stefan Schnitzer and Franziska Schrodt and Urban Šilc and Ben Sparrow and Maria Sporbert and Zvjezdana Stančić and Ben Strohbach and Jens-Christian Svenning and Cindy Q. Tang and Zhiyao Tang and Alexander Christian Vibrans and Cyrille Violle and Donald Waller and Desalegn Wana and Hua-Feng Wang and Timothy Whitfeld and Georg Zizka and Francesco Maria Sabatini and Helge Bruelheide},
